Loads 4 signed BYTEs from unaligned memory and converts them into 4 FLOATs.
@param Ptr			Unaligned memory pointer to the 4 BYTEs.
@return				VectorRegister4Float( float(Ptr[0]), float(Ptr[1]), float(Ptr[2]), float(Ptr[3]) )

